@startuml J-智能助手
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · J 智能助手（UC-SUB-J-01 ~ J-13）
' 「民生小助手」为公共服务能力，不单列为参与者
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · J 智能助手
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "消费者" as CONSUMER
actor "平台运营方" as OPER

rectangle "J 智能助手" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-01 提供分角色使用指导" as J01
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-02 导航到目标页面" as J02
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-03 推荐商品并说明理由" as J03
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-04 理解多轮对话上下文" as J04
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-05 兜底并转人工反馈" as J05
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-06 管控内容安全与幻觉" as J06
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-07 构建个人画像中心" as J07
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-08 管理画像并行使四权" as J08
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-09 增强个性化推荐" as J09
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-10 推送个性化信息" as J10
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-11 提供个性化使用引导" as J11
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-12 治理助手服务" as J12
  usecase "UC-SUB-J-13 澄清式导购选品" as J13
}

CONSUMER --> J01
CONSUMER --> J02
CONSUMER --> J03
CONSUMER --> J07
CONSUMER --> J08
CONSUMER --> J09
CONSUMER --> J10
CONSUMER --> J11
CONSUMER --> J13
OPER --> J04
OPER --> J05
OPER --> J06
OPER --> J12

J09 ..> J03 : <<include>>
J13 ..> J02 : <<include>>

note bottom of J01
  通用基础设施·全角色共用（J-01/J-02/J-07/J-08），此处连消费者为代表参与者
end note
note bottom of J04
  J-04/J-05/J-06 为助手模块级能力（随 M1）
end note
@enduml
